  "instructions": [
    "1. Peel and grate the celeriac.",
    "2. Shred the cabbage.",
    "3. In a large bowl, combine the celeriac, cabbage, fish sauce, rice vinegar, honey, chili flakes, salt, and pepper.",
    "4. Toss to combine and adjust seasoning as needed.",
    "5. Lay the wrap flat and spread the celeriac slaw down the center of the wrap.",
    "6. Fold the bottom half of the wrap up over the filling, then fold in the sides and roll the wrap up tightly.",
    "7. Slice in half and serve immediately.",
    "8. Serve with additional chili flakes or fish sauce on the side, if desired."
